{"title":"Flight Feather","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Harpy, Fledgling Harpy</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"fledgling-harpy\" title=\"Fledgling Harpy - dropped it in 34 of 51 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/5e20684bb6f8862fa4e7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fledgling Harpy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–5</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"harpy\" title=\"Harpy - dropped it in 108 of 169 looted corpses (1/1.6)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/678b44f534ffde7b2c53.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Harpy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.6<br>×1–7</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"flight-feather\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/e99c04a7b052d79e71e0.svg\" alt=\"Flight Feather\"></div><h3>Flight Feather</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/17/2026, 9:46:29 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}